WEBVTT

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:12.652
I've never stayed up this late in my life!

00:00:12.732 --> 00:00:13.772
(GIRLS GIGGLING)

00:00:37.532 --> 00:00:38.892
(ALL CHEERING)

00:00:49.212 --> 00:00:50.372
(DANCE MUSIC FADES)

00:01:22.612 --> 00:01:23.732
(ROARS SOFTLY)

00:01:24.892 --> 00:01:27.252
(WHISTLES) Hey, quiet! Quiet!

00:01:27.972 --> 00:01:29.532
Quiet down, you can-wranglers.

00:01:30.052 --> 00:01:32.012
All right. On behalf of the RORs,

00:01:32.332 --> 00:01:35.692
we'd like to congratulate all the teams
that have made it this far.

00:01:35.812 --> 00:01:36.932
(ALL CHEERING)

00:01:37.532 --> 00:01:38.532
All, right, let's hear it for the PNKs!

00:01:38.652 --> 00:01:39.732
(ALL HISSING)

00:01:40.012 --> 00:01:42.292
I love that trick! Never gets old. HSS!

00:01:42.572 --> 00:01:43.692
(HISSES)

00:01:43.972 --> 00:01:45.012
(CHUCKLES) Very creepy.

00:01:45.092 --> 00:01:49.332
And finally, the surprise team
of the Scare Games,

00:01:50.132 --> 00:01:51.212
-Oozma Kappa!
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:52.772
Come on over, guys.

00:01:54.772 --> 00:01:56.172
Now, I got to admit, fellas,

00:01:56.532 --> 00:01:58.692
I thought you were a bunch of nobodies.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:00.972
But, boy, was I wrong.

00:02:01.452 --> 00:02:03.332
Let's hear it for Oozma Kappa!

00:02:03.492 --> 00:02:05.532
CROWD: Oozma Kappa!

00:02:05.612 --> 00:02:06.812
Oh!

00:02:08.372 --> 00:02:09.412
What?

00:02:09.652 --> 00:02:12.652
The most adorable monsters
on campus.

00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:16.892
CROWD: Ooh! Oh!

00:02:17.172 --> 00:02:18.172
(CROWD LAUGHING)

00:02:21.812 --> 00:02:23.492
Release the stuffed animals.

00:02:26.772 --> 00:02:28.212
(CHET CHUCKLES)

00:02:28.292 --> 00:02:29.612
Faced!

00:02:33.332 --> 00:02:36.652
Don't worry. (GRUMBLES)
Nobody reads the school paper.

00:02:36.732 --> 00:02:39.252
Yeah, but I'm pretty sure
they read the quad.

00:02:43.012 --> 00:02:44.692
(MONSTERS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:02:44.852 --> 00:02:46.252
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:02:51.172 --> 00:02:52.252
MONSTER: Whoo-hoo!

00:02:57.252 --> 00:02:58.292
CHET: Thank you very much.

00:02:58.372 --> 00:02:59.932
Okay. Would you like that
with two sleeves or four?

00:03:00.012 --> 00:03:01.252
Thanks. Tell your friends.

00:03:02.372 --> 00:03:03.852
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:03:03.932 --> 00:03:05.172
Raising a little money for charity.

00:03:05.492 --> 00:03:06.692
Yeah? Well, stop it.

00:03:06.972 --> 00:03:09.332
You want us to stop raising money
for charity? That's not cool.

00:03:09.412 --> 00:03:10.772
This guy hates charity!

00:03:11.452 --> 00:03:13.852
I want you to stop making us
look like fools.

00:03:14.212 --> 00:03:16.772
Hey, you're making yourselves
look like fools.

00:03:17.212 --> 00:03:18.612
Let's be honest, boys.

00:03:18.692 --> 00:03:20.652
You're never going to be real Scarers,

00:03:20.732 --> 00:03:23.532
because real Scarers look like us.

00:03:23.612 --> 00:03:24.852
(LAUGHS MOCKINGLY)

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:28.892
But, hey, if you really want
to work for a Scare company

00:03:29.372 --> 00:03:32.132
they're always hiring in the mailroom.

00:03:32.732 --> 00:03:33.812
(CROWD LAUGHING)

00:03:37.612 --> 00:03:39.212
Guys, hold on!

00:03:39.772 --> 00:03:42.492
Hey, hey, hey! Wait a second.
Don't listen to him.

00:03:42.732 --> 00:03:44.252
We just need to keep trying.

00:03:44.532 --> 00:03:46.492
No, you need to stop trying!

00:03:46.572 --> 00:03:48.932
You can train monsters like this
all you want,

00:03:49.012 --> 00:03:50.532
but you can't change who they are.

00:03:51.572 --> 00:03:52.572
(SIGHS)

00:03:56.492 --> 00:03:57.492
DON: Mike...

00:03:58.172 --> 00:04:01.692
We appreciate everything you've done,
but he's right.

00:04:03.412 --> 00:04:07.332
No matter how much we train,
we'll never look like them.

00:04:09.892 --> 00:04:11.292
We're built

00:04:12.332 --> 00:04:13.452
for other things.

00:04:24.532 --> 00:04:25.692
(SLURPS)

00:04:25.772 --> 00:04:26.772
Sorry, squirt!

00:04:26.852 --> 00:04:29.212
Some monsters just aren't
cut out for the big leagues.

00:04:29.332 --> 00:04:30.612
(LAUGHING)

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:34.372
The big leagues.

00:04:35.092 --> 00:04:36.132
Guys.

00:04:37.372 --> 00:04:38.372
We're going on a little field trip.

00:04:47.612 --> 00:04:49.252
(ALL CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

00:04:49.332 --> 00:04:50.772
TERRY: My tentacle fell asleep.

00:04:51.132 --> 00:04:52.772
-Thanks, Mom.
-Have fun, kids!

00:04:52.852 --> 00:04:55.572
I'll just be here listening to my tunes.

00:04:56.892 --> 00:04:59.292
(THRASH METAL BLARING
ON STEREO)

00:05:00.452 --> 00:05:02.892
Hey, uh, where are we?

00:05:02.972 --> 00:05:04.292
The big leagues.

00:05:12.772 --> 00:05:14.212
Holy roly-poly.

00:05:14.332 --> 00:05:15.332
Wow.

00:05:15.412 --> 00:05:16.972
Nice fence.

00:05:17.052 --> 00:05:18.892
This is amazing, Mike.

00:05:19.212 --> 00:05:20.732
We're not stopping here.

